---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Hussain Rao (Hussain MS): IIT Kharagpur engineer working on data, digital public infrastructure and AI for public health in India.">
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="--dot:var(--yellow)">About</div>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Hussain.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Engineer by training, public health by choice. On official records and my CV, I'm <strong>Hussain MS</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="wrap about-grid">
  <article class="prose" style="--c:var(--yellow)">
    <p>I grew up in Hyderabad and studied at IIT Kharagpur, India's first IIT, built on the site of the old Hijli Detention Camp. I spent five years there on a dual B.Tech and M.Tech in Biotechnology and Biochemical Engineering. The coursework that stayed with me was the quantitative part: programming, data analysis, probability and statistics. My research ranged from running statistics on fully homomorphic encrypted data to mapping the COVID-19 vaccine landscape while the pandemic was unfolding.</p>
    <p>Kharagpur sits away from any city, and the villages around campus are poor. As unit leader of a 30-student National Service Scheme team, I organised relief drives for Brahmaputra flood victims, managed the building of two village roads in Khelar, and taught in two schools near campus for two years.</p>
    <p>Since 2022 I've worked inside India's public health system. At <strong>PATH</strong> I advised three state governments on hospital oxygen, built a WhatsApp chatbot for biomedical engineers, and helped run a USAID maternal health programme in Assam's tea gardens and tribal Chhattisgarh and Odisha. At <strong>Deloitte</strong> I work on digital transformation for government. As a consultant to the <strong>Asian Development Bank</strong>, I'm the data strategist to the National Urban Health Mission.</p>
    <p>What ties it together: I like problems where data, design and people have to be fixed at the same time, and I like building the thing rather than only recommending it.</p>
    <p>Off work: football, taekwondo and theatre.</p>
    <p><a class="btn cv" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=CV%20request`} style="text-decoration:none;margin-top:8px">Request my CV →</a></p>
  </article>
  <aside>
    <figure class="photo"><picture><source srcset="/img/hussain-rao.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/img/hussain-rao.jpg" alt="Portrait of Hussain Rao" width="800" height="800"></picture></figure>
    <h2 class="side-h">Education</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><span class="when">2016–2021</span><b>IIT Kharagpur</b><span>B.Tech + M.Tech, Biotechnology &amp; Biochemical Engineering</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2020</span><b>GATE: All India Rank 209</b><span>National postgraduate engineering examination</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2016</span><b>JEE Main: All India Rank 256</b><span>National engineering entrance examination</span></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="side-h">Work</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><span class="when">Mar 2026 – now</span><b>Asian Development Bank</b><span>Consultant (Data Strategist), National Urban Health Mission</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">Sep 2025 – now</span><b>Deloitte</b><span>Senior Consultant, Government &amp; Public Services</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">Jan 2022 – Sep 2025</span><b>PATH</b><span>Engineer → Associate → Senior Associate</span></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="side-h">Recognition</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><span class="when">2023</span><b>PATH ACE Team</b></li>
      <li><span class="when">2022</span><b>PATH Vision Award</b></li>
      <li><span class="when">2019</span><b>Elected General Secretary</b><span>JCB Hall, IIT Kharagpur</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2018</span><b>Best Volunteer</b><span>National Service Scheme, IIT Kharagpur</span></li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</div>
</Base>
